---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { ArrowRight, MessageSquare, Mic, Users, Sparkles, Calendar, Clock } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<Layout>
  <section class="pt-16 sm:pt-28 pb-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div data-reveal="fade-up" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-[var(--color-line)] bg-[var(--color-paper-soft)] text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] mb-8">
        <Sparkles class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[var(--color-accent)]" />
        <span>For the IVS 2026 organizers · proposal from Zunou</span>
      </div>

      <h1 data-reveal="fade-up" data-reveal-delay="1" class="font-display text-[3rem] sm:text-[4.5rem] lg:text-[5.5rem] leading-[1.03] tracking-tight mb-7 max-w-5xl">
        Make IVS 2026 the <span class="text-[var(--color-accent)]">most-networked</span> startup conference in Asia.
      </h1>

      <p data-reveal="fade-up" data-reveal-delay="2" class="text-xl sm:text-2xl text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] max-w-[64ch] leading-[1.55] mb-6">
        Networking is the number one reason 13,000 people fly to Kyoto. It's also the number one complaint after they leave. We have a fix that costs IVS zero, lifts attendee NPS, and gives you a story worth pitching to sponsors next year. Three slides.
      </p>

      <div data-reveal="fade-up" data-reveal-delay="2" class="border-l-2 border-[var(--color-accent)] pl-5 py-2 mb-10 max-w-[60ch]">
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[var(--color-ink)] leading-[1.55]">
          <strong class="font-semibold">The matching is the cake.</strong> Voice intro, Zunou pulls the insight, two attendees get paired, they meet wherever they like: a panel room, a café, the venue floor, their hotel lobby. The platform runs as a PWA on every phone. It works without any booth.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] leading-[1.55] mt-3">
          The <strong class="text-[var(--color-ink)] font-semibold">Corner is the icing.</strong> A 4×4m branded space turns matching into a story, a scarcity, and a photo. Pairs who want one can land there. The cake works without the icing. The icing only works with the cake.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div data-reveal="fade-up" data-reveal-delay="3" class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-10">
        <div class="border border-[var(--color-line)] bg-[var(--color-paper-soft)] rounded-lg px-5 py-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5 text-[var(--color-accent)]">
            <Calendar class="w-4 h-4" />
            <span class="font-display text-2xl text-[var(--color-ink)]">Jul 1-3</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] font-medium">IVS 2026 · Kyoto</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-[var(--color-line)] bg-[var(--color-paper-soft)] rounded-lg px-5 py-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5 text-[var(--color-accent)]">
            <Users class="w-4 h-4" />
            <span class="font-display text-2xl text-[var(--color-ink)]">13,000+</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] font-medium">Attendees from 70 countries</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-[var(--color-line)] bg-[var(--color-paper-soft)] rounded-lg px-5 py-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5 text-[var(--color-accent)]">
            <Mic class="w-4 h-4" />
            <span class="font-display text-2xl text-[var(--color-ink)]">30s</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] font-medium">to match someone worth meeting</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-[var(--color-line)] bg-[var(--color-paper-soft)] rounded-lg px-5 py-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5 text-[var(--color-accent)]">
            <Clock class="w-4 h-4" />
            <span class="font-display text-2xl text-[var(--color-ink)]">15 min</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] font-medium">per slot · 8 simultaneous pairs</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div data-reveal="fade-up" data-reveal-delay="4" class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/corner" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 rounded-md bg-[var(--color-accent)] text-white hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity font-medium">
          See the Corner mechanic <ArrowRight class="w-4 h-4" />
        </a>
        <a href="/value" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 rounded-md border border-[var(--color-line)] hover:bg-[var(--color-paper-soft)] transition-colors">
          What IVS gets
        </a>
        <a href="/ask" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 rounded-md border border-[var(--color-line)] hover:bg-[var(--color-paper-soft)] transition-colors">
          The ask
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-[var(--color-paper-soft)] border-y border-[var(--color-line)]">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
        <div data-reveal="fade-up">
          <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--color-accent)] font-semibold mb-4">The gap you already know about</div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl leading-[1.1] tracking-tight mb-6">
            "Serendipitous encounters" is what we say when the event app open rate is 4%.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] leading-[1.6] mb-4">
            The 2026 site frames networking as a feature: Family Tree, Founder Ranking, real-time business meetings, the CORE Lounge. The intent is right. The execution has a known ceiling: messaging-app conventions don't work at 13k-person scale, and "wandering until something happens" leaves most attendees with a stack of cards they never follow up on.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] leading-[1.6]">
            The fix isn't another in-app inbox. It's a physical, opt-in, time-boxed activation that turns serendipity into a contract: <strong class="text-[var(--color-ink)] font-semibold">sit down, meet someone you should meet, leave with the follow up already in your calendar.</strong>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div data-reveal="fade-up" data-reveal-delay="2" class="space-y-3">
          <div class="border border-[var(--color-line)] bg-[var(--color-paper)] rounded-lg p-5">
            <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--color-ink-faint)] font-semibold mb-2">What attendees say after</div>
            <div class="font-display text-lg leading-snug">"I met lots of people. I'm not sure which ones mattered."</div>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-[var(--color-line)] bg-[var(--color-paper)] rounded-lg p-5">
            <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--color-ink-faint)] font-semibold mb-2">What sponsors ask</div>
            <div class="font-display text-lg leading-snug">"Who from our ICP did we actually reach?"</div>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-[var(--color-line)] bg-[var(--color-paper)] rounded-lg p-5">
            <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--color-ink-faint)] font-semibold mb-2">What gets surveyed</div>
            <div class="font-display text-lg leading-snug">"Networking quality" is the lowest-scoring line item at every Asian tier-1 conference.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div data-reveal="fade-up">
        <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--color-accent)] font-semibold mb-4">The offer</div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl leading-[1.1] tracking-tight mb-6 max-w-4xl">
          The Zunou Corner. A 4×4m branded activation that produces 240 high-quality conversations across three days.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] leading-[1.6] max-w-[60ch] mb-8">
          Attendees record a 30-second voice intro. Zunou matches them on what they're actually working on this week, not their job title. They sit for 15 minutes. They leave with the conversation summary, the contact, and a follow up nudge already scheduled for two weeks out. The conference ends. The network compounds.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="/corner" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 rounded-md bg-[var(--color-ink)] text-[var(--color-paper)] hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity font-medium">
            See the mechanic <ArrowRight class="w-4 h-4" />
          </a>
          <a href="/value" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 rounded-md border border-[var(--color-line)] hover:bg-[var(--color-paper-soft)] transition-colors">
            What IVS gets <ArrowRight class="w-4 h-4" />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
